  "body": "# Installation\n\n__Linux and macOS:__\n\n```sh\n# Linux\ncurl -L https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-linux-amd64 -o kompose\n\n# Linux ARM64\ncurl -L https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-linux-arm64 -o kompose\n\n# macOS\ncurl -L https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-amd64 -o kompose\n\n# macOS ARM64\ncurl -L https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-arm64 -o kompose\n\nchmod +x kompose\nsudo mv ./kompose /usr/local/bin/kompose\n```\n\n__Windows:__\n\nDownload from [GitHub](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-windows-amd64.exe) and add the binary to your PATH.\n\n__Checksums:__\n\n| Filename        | SHA256 Hash |\n| ------------- |:-------------:|\n[kompose-darwin-amd64](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-amd64) | a6c663df22610dec6b005e7c93b66bb46e33161707b7bb1cbee3bcdbf09cbb34\n[kompose-darwin-amd64.tar.gz](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-amd64.tar.gz) | b0a75ea83ce64babd7ab7d7d9c6db6b55844929f6910d82d0d5b38bab2b733ad\n[kompose-darwin-arm64](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-arm64) | 5687d79633854d5fc8151a0148fd6045b643e3f745f7413106c807fe63fe97eb\n[kompose-darwin-arm64.tar.gz](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-darwin-arm64.tar.gz) | aff7b2eb9c7cd80cb19ecadaa4344a16cc153172bc236637fabb13443ad82bae\n[kompose-linux-amd64](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-linux-amd64) | 65a6a720605bead3964e8b22d423a0763de451a236fe03de902e366cf3d9c147\n[kompose-linux-amd64.tar.gz](https://github.com/kubernetes/kompose/releases/download/v1.38.0/kompose-linux-amd64.tar.gz) | 60a1c57d15d7499226eb4045bb9a64fa598f2a8bd9f09b5c59f4ce1c74313a11\n[kompose-linux-arm](https://github.com/kubern